      "recipe": "ffmpeg lavfi sources (aevalsrc / anoisesrc) shaped by the per-layer `filter` in this manifest, then loudness-normalised with every other cue. The expression IS the provenance: nothing is downloaded, nobody is credited, and the file is reproducible from this repo alone. Used only where no CC0 sample pack has the sound - a rising firework whistle, a low rumble and a champagne fizz bed are not in Kenney's libraries, and Freesound needs an API key nobody has supplied yet (plan 3.3.1, phase 6)."
